## Build System
- Windows: `.\build.ps1` (sets TEXINPUTS + BSTINPUTS automatically)
- Linux/Mac: `make all`
- Docx for advisor: `.\build.ps1 -Docx` → edits/
- Single chapter: `.\build.ps1 -Chapter 2`
- Output directory: output/

